{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Touchpoints",
                  "field": "touchpoints",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Send Event",
                  "field": "send_event",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "process_execution",
                      "params": {
                        "mechanism": "Send Event"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "AppleScript",
                  "field": "applescript",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "process_execution",
                      "params": {
                        "mechanism": "AppleScript"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "MBS process calls",
                  "field": "mbs_calls",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files affected",
                  "field": "files_affected",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "by_mechanism",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "By mechanism"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "by_mechanism"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "by_mechanism_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "mechanism",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "mechanism",
                  "label": "Mechanism",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "kind",
                  "label": "Kind"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "process_execution",
                  "params": {
                    "mechanism": "{{mechanism}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Call sites",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "step_uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "mechanism",
                  "label": "Mechanism",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "ref_type",
                  "label": "Ref type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "carrier",
                  "label": "Script/Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "detail",
                  "label": "Step/Function"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "step_index",
                  "label": "#",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{nav_type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "params": {
                    "step": "{{step_uuid}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nWhere the solution hands control to an **external process or shell**. Native steps are Step_ID-gated (locale-independent): *Send Event* (57), *Perform AppleScript* (67). MBS process calls are read from the resolved `calls_pluginfunction` links: `Shell.*`, `RunTask.*`, `Process.*`.\n\n- **KPIs as filters**: *Send Event* and *AppleScript* filter the detail list to that mechanism.\n- **By mechanism**: click a row to filter the call sites.\n- **Navigation**: clicking a call site opens the carrier (Script + step anchor, or the object behind an MBS call).\n- **Related rules**: derived severity rules live under *Static Code Analysis*.\n- **Sorting**: all column headings are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
